  "name": "Hybrid Form",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Flesh_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You take on a form halfway between yourself and a beast.</p><p>Choose any animal with a maximum <strong>Stamina</strong> no higher than your own.</p><p>The choose:</p><ul><li><p>1 stat (such as Body, Athletics, Swim Speed, Size, etc).</p></li><li><p>1 ability (such as a bite attack, water-breathing, etc).</p></li></ul><p>For the next minute, your chosen stat becomes the same as that of the animal. You also gain the chosen ability the animal possesses.</p><p>Each extra success increases the duration by 1 round.</p>",
